[36m(TaskRunner pid=498088)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=498088)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=498088)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = 2.4 - \frac{t}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=498088)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=498088)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=498088)[0m Now substitute $ t $ from Equation 1a into this:
