[36m(TaskRunner pid=498088)[0m ### Step 2: Prime Factorization of $ 9! $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=498088)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=498088)[0m We can write $ 9! $ as a product of its prime factors:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=498088)[0m 
