[36m(TaskRunner pid=498088)[0m However, note that a divisor ending in 1 (i.e., having a units digit of 1) must be congruent to 1 modulo 10. Numbers ending in 1 can't be divisible by 2 or 5 (since those would make the units digit even or 0 or 5).
